    "title": "Pluto TV: Watch Free Movies/TV",
    "description": "Get into the holiday spirit with your favorite films including Tyler Perry\u2019s A Madea Christmas, The Last Holiday and Planes, Trains and Automobiles. Watch criminally good TV shows such as CSI: Vegas, Criminal Minds and NCIS all month long. Jump into the drama with Tracker, The Equalizer and Fire Country.\r\n\r\nPluto TV is the leading free streaming television service to watch free entertainment! Stream now, pay never. Get ready to binge any time you want with:\r\n- 100s of live TV streaming channels\r\n- 1000s of free movies and TV shows\r\n- 24/7 entertainment\r\n\r\nPluto TV is your app to watch free movies and TV shows anywhere, on any device. Download today and discover the easy way to stream all your favorite content for free.\r\n\r\nWatch free shows, sports, classic TV and blockbuster films. Whatever you choose, Pluto TV is available on any device and from any location. Explore a variety of movie and TV genres, including:\r\n- Action: \u201cGladiator\" and \"Inception\"\r\n- Anime: \u201cNaruto\u201d and \u201cOne Piece\u201d\r\n- Comedy: \u201cKnives Out\" and \"Tyler Perry's A Madea Family Funeral\"\r\n- True Crime: \u201cCold Case Files\u201d and \u201c48 Hours\u201d\r\n- Romance: \"Forrest Gump\" and \"Good Will Hunting\"\r\n- Sci-Fi: \u201cStar Trek: The Original Series\u201d and \u201cTransformers: Dark of the Moon\"\r\n- Spanish TV: \"Acapulco Shore\" and \u201cNothing Like the Holidays\"\r\n- Thrillers: \u201cMission: Impossible \u2013 Ghost Protocol\" and \"No Time to Die\"\r\n\r\nDownload Pluto TV for endless video streaming entertainment options with new movies and shows added constantly. Discover a better way to stream movies and TV free.\r\n\r\nPLUTO TV OPTIONS\r\n\r\nWATCH MOVIES ANYWHERE\r\n- Watch movies for free with exclusive movie channels and more in our extensive library\r\n- Stream movies free with everything from family-friendly and action films, to sci-fi and romance flicks\r\n- \u00bfBuscas una pel\u00edcula o una telenovela? \u00a1Pluto TV tiene tus favoritos gratis en espa\u00f1ol!\r\n\r\nSTREAMING FEATURES THAT WORK FOR YOU\r\n- Save frequently watched channels to a personalized Favorites List in the Live TV section\r\n- Set a profile to Kids Mode that only shows family-friendly's content for younger viewers\r\n- Share content to social media from your mobile device, tablet or TV to show others what you\u2019re streaming\r\n\r\nWATCH TV YOUR WAY\r\n- Watch your favorite TV shows with over 250 live channels\r\n- Stream TV with free shows such as Blue Bloods, Jersey Shore, RuPaul\u2019s Drag Race, South Park and much more\r\n- Watch TV seasons of popular hits like Star Trek, Survivor and Unsolved Mysteries\r\n\r\nSTREAM SPORTS, NEWS, SPECIALS & MORE\r\n- Watch live sports including basketball, football, baseball and classic games\r\n- Dive into hilarious shows and stand-up specials\r\n- Stream breaking news, opinion and stats\r\n\r\nCheck back often so you don\u2019t miss the new movies and TV shows we add to our library daily. Stream TV networks and top content providers, including:\r\n- BET\r\n- CBS\r\n- Comedy Central\r\n- Lionsgate\r\n- MGM\r\n- MTV\r\n- NBC\r\n- Nickelodeon\r\n- Paramount\r\n- SHOWTIME\r\n- Sony Pictures\r\n- Warner Bros. Discovery\r\n- And more!\r\n\r\nWatch free movies and TV shows everywhere, 100% free and legal. Download Pluto TV today!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/policy\r\nChildren's Privacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/childrens\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://privacy.paramount.com/app-donotsell\r\nTerms of Use: https://legal.paramount.com/plutotv/terms-of-use\r\nCalifornia Notice: https://privacy.paramount.com/en/policy#additional-information-us-states",
